            <ArticleTitle>Clinical Inquiry: How effective are opioids for chronic low back pain?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>584-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Short-term (&lt;4 months) treatment with opioids provides modest relief of chronic low back pain, but only minimal improvement in function compared with placebo.</AbstractText>
